;; Example patterns for Hatch Pattern Bench, written for this project.
*EX-RUNNING-BOND, Example: running bond, 2 x 1 units
0, 0,0, 0,1
90, 0,0, 1,1, 1,-1

*EX-BASKETWEAVE, Example: basketweave, pairs of 2 x 1 planks in 2 x 2 cells
0, 0,0, 0,2
0, 0,1, 2,2, 2,-2
90, 0,0, 0,2
90, 1,2, 2,2, 2,-2

*EX-CROSSHATCH, Example: diagonal crosshatch at 0.5 spacing
45, 0,0, 0,0.5
135, 0,0, 0,0.5

*EX-DASH-DOT-GRID, Example: dash-dot grid, 1 unit cells
0, 0,0, 0,1, 0.5,-0.25,0,-0.25
90, 0,0, 0,1, 0.5,-0.25,0,-0.25
